# Copy to .env.local and fill in from your Supabase project:
#   Dashboard -> Project Settings -> Data API  (URL)
#   Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API Keys  (anon / publishable key)
#
# Both are baked into the browser bundle at build time. That is expected: the
# anon key is a publishable key, and Row Level Security is what protects user
# rows. Never put the service_role key here — it bypasses RLS entirely.
#
# Leaving these unset is supported: the app then runs fully local, on the
# bundled catalog and browser-local progress, with the sign-in control hidden.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
